  ('The Phoenix Project', 'Gene Kim', '9781942788294', 'Technology', 'https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781942788294-L.jpg?default=false', 'An IT manager is given ninety days to rescue a failing project before his department is outsourced. A novel that teaches the ideas behind DevOps through one company''s very bad quarter.', 2, 2, UTC_TIMESTAMP() - INTERVAL 19 MINUTE, UTC_TIMESTAMP() - INTERVAL 19 MINUTE),
